#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/extracted-outputs/ae2d9390-5c26-46f3-9418-a684ba8a406a-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Saída da célula de código anterior](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-stages/extracted-outputs/ae2d9390-5c26-46f3-9418-a684ba8a406a-0.svg)\n"

